  "body": "Seen in a reachable-files GUI run at load ~140 (pi compaction model change, kautism): `not ok 905 - chromium de 390px: omp's roles and their thinking levels are one square, OpenCode's small model is a picker` with `locator.waitFor: Timeout 5000ms exceeded`. Passes alone (omp-roles.test.cjs, 66/66 with two siblings). A wait that a busy machine outlasts; the class is a timing assumption a user's busy machine meets too.\n\n```\n  ...\n# Subtest: chromium de 390px: omp's roles and their thinking levels are one square, OpenCode's small model is a picker\nnot ok 905 - chromium de 390px: omp's roles and their thinking levels are one square, OpenCode's small model is a picker\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 7984.843959\n  type: 'test'\n  location: '/Users/yetone/workspace/projects/magpie-wt/pi-compact-model/internal/gui/tests/omp-roles.test.cjs:116:5'\n  failureType: 'testCodeFailure'\n  error: |-\n    locator.waitFor: Timeout 5000ms exceeded.\n    Call log:\n    ^[[2m  - waiting for locator('.row.agent[data-id=\"omp\"]') to be visible^[[22m\n    \n  code: 'ERR_TEST_FAILURE'\n  name: 'TimeoutError'\n  stack: |-\n    TestContext.<anonymous> (/Users/yetone/workspace/projects/magpie-wt/pi-compact-model/internal/gui/tests/omp-roles.test.cjs:132:31)\n  ...\n# Subtest: webkit en 1100px: omp's roles and their thinking levels are one square, OpenCode's small model is a picker\nok 906 - webkit en 1100px: omp's roles and their thinking levels are one square, OpenCode's small model is a picker\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 14152.60075\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: webkit zh 1100px: omp's roles and their thinking levels are one square, OpenCode's small model is a picker\nok 907 - webkit zh 1100px: omp's roles and their thinking levels are one square, OpenCode's small model is a picker\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 15524.893958\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: webkit ja 1100px: omp's roles and their thinking levels are one square, OpenCode's small model is a picker\nok 908 - webkit ja 1100px: omp's roles and their thinking levels are one square, OpenCode's small model is a picker\n  ---\n```",
